<title>USA: FGIC qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. said on Wednesday that it qualified for insurance the following three municipal bond issues scheduled for competitive sale today :</p>
<p>--New Haven, Conn., General Obligations (GO), $40 million is a direct purchase.</p>
<p>--Wilson School District, Pa., $34 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Knoxville, Tenn., GOs, $23.34 million public improvement.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
